# Magisk module payload: never let git rewrite line endings.
#
# Android executes service.sh and customize.sh directly. If either lands with
# CRLF endings the shebang becomes "/system/bin/sh\r" and the installer dies
# with "bad interpreter", while update-binary fails to unpack the zip.
# core.autocrlf=true on Windows would otherwise convert these on checkout.
* -text